Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:05.60,TitleGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,460)\fad(500,400)\blur2.5}Sweater Weather\N{\fs88\fsp6\b0}The Neighbourhood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.90,0:00:14.00,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}And all I am is a man\NI want the world in my hands
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:21.80,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}I hate the beach, but I stand\NIn California, with my toes in the sand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:25.80,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Use the sleeves of my sweater\NLet's have an adventure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:29.60,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Head in the clouds\NBut my gravity's centered
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:37.40,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Touch my neck, and I'll touch yours\nYou in those little high-waisted shorts, oh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:42.60,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}She knows what I think about\NAnd what I think about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:46.70,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}One love, two mouths\NOne love, one house
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:50.50,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}No shirt, no blouse\NJust us, you find out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.70,0:00:56.50,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Nothing that I wouldn't\NWanna tell you about, no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.70,0:01:00.60,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}'Cause it's too cold\NFor you here and now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:09.50,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}So let me hold\NBoth your hands in the holes of my sweater
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:13.50,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}And if I may just take your breath away\NI don't mind if there's not much to say
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:17.50,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Sometimes the silence guides our minds\NSo move to a place so far away
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.70,0:01:21.50,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}The goosebumps start to raise\nThe minute that my left hand meets your waist
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:23.20,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}And then I watch your face
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:25.80,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Put my finger on your tongue\N'Cause you love to taste, yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:29.20,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}These hearts adore\NEveryone the other beats hardest for
